# GEMV y = A(2048x2048) * x(2048), LPDDR4 method 1: store partial sums in GPR.
# Mapping assumption:
# - LPDDR4 maps 2048 matrix rows as 8 output batches over 32 channels x 8 banks.
# - Each output batch uses two DRAM rows per bank:
#   row 2*b stores columns 0..1023, row 2*b+1 stores columns 1024..2047.
# - Each 1024-wide BF16 half-row occupies 64 AiM 256b chunks.
# - x[0:1024] is loaded once, all first-half partial sums are computed and read to GPR.
# - x[1024:2048] is loaded once, partial sums are written back as bias and completed.
# - GPR0 stores vector half 0, GPR64 stores vector half 1, GPR128 stores zero bias.
# - GPR256+b stores partial sums for output batch b; GPR512+b receives final outputs.
AiM WR_GB 64 0 0xffffffff
W CFR 0 1
AiM WR_BIAS 128 0xffffffff
AiM MAC_ABK 64 0xffffffff 0
AiM RD_MAC 256 0xffffffff
AiM WR_BIAS 128 0xffffffff
AiM MAC_ABK 64 0xffffffff 2
AiM RD_MAC 257 0xffffffff
AiM WR_BIAS 128 0xffffffff
AiM MAC_ABK 64 0xffffffff 4
AiM RD_MAC 258 0xffffffff
AiM WR_BIAS 128 0xffffffff
AiM MAC_ABK 64 0xffffffff 6
AiM RD_MAC 259 0xffffffff
AiM WR_BIAS 128 0xffffffff
AiM MAC_ABK 64 0xffffffff 8
AiM RD_MAC 260 0xffffffff
AiM WR_BIAS 128 0xffffffff
AiM MAC_ABK 64 0xffffffff 10
AiM RD_MAC 261 0xffffffff
AiM WR_BIAS 128 0xffffffff
AiM MAC_ABK 64 0xffffffff 12
AiM RD_MAC 262 0xffffffff
AiM WR_BIAS 128 0xffffffff
AiM MAC_ABK 64 0xffffffff 14
AiM RD_MAC 263 0xffffffff
AiM WR_GB 64 64 0xffffffff
AiM WR_BIAS 256 0xffffffff
AiM MAC_ABK 64 0xffffffff 1
AiM RD_MAC 512 0xffffffff
AiM WR_BIAS 257 0xffffffff
AiM MAC_ABK 64 0xffffffff 3
AiM RD_MAC 513 0xffffffff
AiM WR_BIAS 258 0xffffffff
AiM MAC_ABK 64 0xffffffff 5
AiM RD_MAC 514 0xffffffff
AiM WR_BIAS 259 0xffffffff
AiM MAC_ABK 64 0xffffffff 7
AiM RD_MAC 515 0xffffffff
AiM WR_BIAS 260 0xffffffff
AiM MAC_ABK 64 0xffffffff 9
AiM RD_MAC 516 0xffffffff
AiM WR_BIAS 261 0xffffffff
AiM MAC_ABK 64 0xffffffff 11
AiM RD_MAC 517 0xffffffff
AiM WR_BIAS 262 0xffffffff
AiM MAC_ABK 64 0xffffffff 13
AiM RD_MAC 518 0xffffffff
AiM WR_BIAS 263 0xffffffff
AiM MAC_ABK 64 0xffffffff 15
AiM RD_MAC 519 0xffffffff
AiM ISR_EOC
